<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aa3 to Sony Capital samurai bond.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aa3 to Sony Capital samurai bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday that it had assigned an Aa3 senior unsecured debt rating to Sony Capital Corp's 25 billion yen yen/dollar dual currency bond due in 2000.</p>
<p>The rating is based on a keepwell agreement between Sony Corp and Sony Capital.</p>
</text>
